# 64, 64, 1, 1, 64, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, 1,
# E2 fixture: the same total work as configs/mappings/gemmini/gemm_64x64x64 on an 8x8 ACTIVE
# array instead of 16x16. K moves from PE_X 16 to PE_X 8 (with PE picking up the factor 2), and
# C from PE_Y 16 to PE_Y 8 (with GLB picking up the factor 2). Total K = 8*8 = 64 and total
# C = 8*8 = 64 are unchanged, so only the active SHAPE differs -- which is what isolates the
# multicast link-traversal contract.
